&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Jusant DLC 🌦️</title><link>https://victortouroul.fr/posts/jusant/</link><pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://victortouroul.fr/posts/jusant/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;During my first year of the master&amp;rsquo;s program in game design, we had the opportunity to work with the team at &lt;em&gt;Don&amp;rsquo;t Nod&lt;/em&gt;, the creators of the game &lt;em&gt;Jusant&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The project was to create a &lt;strong&gt;vertical slice of a DLC for this game in two months&lt;/strong&gt;. We were divided into two groups of 7 and 8, each consisting of game designers and tech artists. Some tasks were worked on collaboratively (implementation of the core mechanic, character design). I was on the team working on the second part, &lt;em&gt;Embrun&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>